<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Teacher Dashboard - Smart School</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
	<%- include("_header.ejs") %>

	<main class="dashboard-page">
		<div class="dashboard-heading">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Teaching workspace</p>
				<h2>Teacher Dashboard</h2>
				<p>Welcome, <%= user.name || user.email %>. Access your classroom resources.</p>
			</div>
			<a class="dashboard-logout" href="/logout">Log out</a>
		</div>

		<div class="dashboard-cards">
			<article class="dashboard-card">
				<span class="card-icon">01</span>
				<h3>Students</h3>
				<p>Check the student register and classroom details.</p>
				<a href="/students">View students</a>
			</article>
			<article class="dashboard-card">
				<span class="card-icon">02</span>
				<h3>Subjects</h3>
				<p>Review the subjects available for your lessons.</p>
				<a href="/subjects">View subjects</a>
			</article>
			<article class="dashboard-card">
				<span class="card-icon">03</span>
				<h3>Results</h3>
				<p>Review marks and follow academic performance.</p>
				<a href="/results">View results</a>
			</article>
			<article class="dashboard-card">
				<span class="card-icon">04</span>
				<h3>School messages</h3>
				<p>Stay informed about school communication.</p>
				<a href="/messages">Open messages</a>
			</article>
		</div>
	</main>

	<footer><p>&copy; 2026 Smart School. All Rights Reserved.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
